OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir levels recovering, water
OL,4,Acompany says
OL,5,
OL,6,FReservoir levels across the South West
OL,7,Fare starting to recover after recent
OL,8,Frainfall, a water company boss has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FRichard Stanbrook, drought resilience
OL,12,Fdirector for Pennon which owns South
OL,13,FWest Water, said every reservoir in the
OL,14,FSouth West was on an "upward
OL,15,Ftrajectory" with "continued recovery"
OL,16,Fexpected.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
