OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir levels recovering, water
OL,4,Acompany says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrought was declared by the Environment
OL,7,FAgency for more than half of England in
OL,8,FJune before escalating it to a severe
OL,9,Fdrought in October with Wimbleball
OL,10,FReservoir on Exmoor dropping to a
OL,11,Frecord low level of just 12% full.
OL,13,FStanbrook said the hosepipe ban was
OL,14,Fhaving a "positive impact" on improving
OL,15,Flevels but the amount of rainfall in
OL,16,Fcoming months was paramount to them
OL,17,Fbecoming full again.
